          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Sep 10 2020 13:09:36 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Gynnie OB/GYN Stretcher</span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Intuitive patient positioning and simple functionality</span></span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">A.</span>&nbsp;4-inch UltraComfort support surface&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Heat-sealed seams help prevent fluid collection.</span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">B.</span>&nbsp;Pelvic exam conversion&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Three easy steps to convert stretcher into a pelvic exam with self-locking stirrups. The permanently attached components save time and effort.</span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">C.</span>&nbsp;Glideaway siderails&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Swing up and out for mom’s comfort and provide zero transfer gap when lowered.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 02 2024 19:46:04 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0)",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
