          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-fe8967f731@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Sep 10 2020 13:30:40 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">LD304 Birthing Bed</span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Helping to better position your patient</span></span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">A.</span>&nbsp;Powered skoocher system&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Moves mom closer to the perineal edge, reducing strain on caregivers while providing proper back support for mom.</span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">B.</span>&nbsp;Length-adjustable footrests and calf supports&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Offers nearly infinite positioning for customized comfort and slide into place with an easy-squeeze handle.</span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">C.</span>&nbsp;Removable lock-rite foot section&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Simple, safe and exceptionally easy to handle, the Lock-Rite design provides visual confirmation that the foot section is securely locked into place.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 02 2024 19:41:50 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
