      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/columncontrol/cols2",
      "col1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-fe8967f731@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Sep 10 2020 13:30:40 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Nära</span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Closeness when it matters most</span></span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">A.</span> Soft-edge&nbsp;basket with tilting feature</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Secured to the base by three points of contact, the basket helps provide mothers and caregivers peace of mind. A soft-edge basket with tilting feature provides access and visibility to infant for mom and caregiver.</span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">B.</span> Height&nbsp;adjustable</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Adjustable height provides ergonomic positioning for caregivers and mother-to-infant closeness, regardless of bed height.</span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">C.</span> Two-way drawers</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Offers easy access to storage, helping limit disturbance to the newborn. Soft-close slides secure drawers during transport with magnetic catch.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 02 2024 19:43:09 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
