        "text_copy_copy_copy_": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-fe8967f731@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Sep 10 2020 13:30:40 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">ProCuity</span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Help with recovery in our safest and most innovative bed</span></span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">A.</span>&nbsp;IsoTour gel support surface</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Helps keep mom safe by preventing all stages of pressure injuries by addressing key risk factors of skin breakdown: pressure, shear, and moisture.</span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">B.</span>&nbsp;Low height</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">At just 11.5&quot; from the ground, ProCuity's low height makes getting in and out of bed easier for patients, helping to prevent falls and fall-related injuries.</span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">C.&nbsp;</span>Patient assist</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">With nurse assistance, helps put patients in optimal position to assist in getting in and out of bed safely.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 02 2024 19:45:47 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
